@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title US024 - To get the list of items on auction of a given publication

' Participants
actor Buyer
participant ":UI024" as UI024
participant ":ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController" as ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController
participant ":PublicationRepository" as PublicationRepository
participant ":AuctionRepository" as AuctionRepository

Buyer -> UI024 : I want to get the list of items on auction of a given publication
activate UI024
UI024 -> ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController: getAllPublications()
activate ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController
ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController -> PublicationRepository: getAllPublications()
activate PublicationRepository
PublicationRepository --> ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController: listOfAllPublications

deactivate PublicationRepository
ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController --> UI024 : listOfAllPublications
deactivate ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController
Buyer <-- UI024 : Which publication? Choose!
Buyer -> UI024 : publication

UI024 -> ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController : getListOfItemsOnAuction(publication)
activate ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController

ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController -> AuctionRepository : getListOfItemsOnAuction(publication)
activate AuctionRepository

AuctionRepository -> AuctionRepository : validateParameters(publication)


create "l1: List<Auction>" as AuctionList
AuctionRepository -> AuctionList : getList(publication)


AuctionRepository --> ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController : l1
deactivate AuctionRepository

ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController -> ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController : cl1: copyList(l1)

ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController --> UI024 : cl1
deactivate ToGetTheListOfItemsOnAuctionOfAGivenPublicationController

UI024 --> Buyer : List of items on auction
deactivate UI024

@enduml